{"name":"The Eastseat Sign","slug":"glyph-eastseat-sign","blurb":"On the palindrome street, Maren carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Eastseat. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Eastseat Sign.","seal":"f8b08fe71a8e140ecac4c4f796de1406ef775c1a4b8a769d9ef94618f33ef088"}
